+/*
+ * Our (apps) vote for one of the few LDOs listed: its voltage, high-power mode, and on or off. RPMh
+ * aggregates the votes of every processor, so an off vote turns a rail off only if nobody else wants
+ * it. ldoc11: the touch controller's 3.2 V; ldoa18: the panel's vdda-3p3 (3.0 V; MIUI's dsi panel
+ * supply entry 1, cut in dsi_panel_power_off).
+ */
 int
